            "Exactly one point means one repeated root: the discriminant is 0.",
            "{{(-6)^2 - 4(1)(7 - c) = 0}}: 36 − 28 + 4c = 0, so c = −2.",
            "Check: x² − 6x + 9 = {{(x - 3)^2}} = 0, so they touch at (3, 4) ✓.",
